    "type": "equipment",
    "system": {
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>The Flesh Shaper wove the void's cold through your soul, and a thread of it stayed. The dark took your name in payment.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Wrapped in cold light (the gift).</strong> You gain permanent <strong>resistance 10 to cold</strong>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Voice of the gulf.</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">2</span> <strong>(once per day)</strong> You cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.GaRQlC9Yw1BGKHfN]{Wave of Despair} as an innate spell &mdash; a 30-foot cone, Will save. Use your own spell DC, or the standard innate DC for your level if you have none.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>The name given to the dark (the cost).</strong> The world half-forgets you; allies grope for what to call you. You take a permanent <strong>&minus;2 status penalty to Diplomacy</strong>, and may take a new name.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>The cold does not bite its own (the finale).</strong> In the battle with Veyrin, you and your party <strong>ignore the Queen of Shadows' bone-chilling rime</strong>.</p>"
        },
